usage: rot runtime eval [-h] [--rule ID] [--tool NAME] [--arg K=V]
                        [--state JSON] [--quiet]

optional arguments:
  -h, --help    show this help message and exit
  --rule ID     rule id [default: spendcap_within_cap]
  --tool NAME   the tool name being called (required)
  --arg K=V     a tool argument (repeatable; JSON value if parseable)
  --state JSON  the guard's state as a JSON object, e.g. {"completed": 0,
                "inflight": 3}
  --quiet       suppress the human summary
